srow(306, 29, 'MATERIAL', f'ANOTHER WORD: "MY DOCTRINE SHALL DROP AS THE RAIN" — R. MEIR USED TO SAY: ALWAYS GATHER WORDS OF TORAH AS GENERAL RULES, FOR IF YOU GATHER THEM AS PARTICULARS THEY WEARY YOU AND YOU KNOW NOT WHAT TO DO — A PARABLE OF A MAN GOING TO CAESAREA NEEDING A HUNDRED OR TWO HUNDRED ZUZ FOR EXPENSES: IF HE TAKES THEM IN SMALL COIN THEY WEARY HIM, BUT HE COMBINES THEM INTO SELAS AND BREAKS THEM WHEREVER HE WISHES; AND ONE GOING TO THE MARKET OF BEIT ILYIS NEEDING A HUNDRED MANEH OR TWO MYRIADS: IF HE COMBINES THEM INTO SELAS THEY WEARY HIM, BUT HE MAKES THEM GOLD DINARS AND BREAKS THEM WHEREVER HE WISHES. ({SP_(306, 29, "שאם", "אתה", "כונסם", "פרטים", "מיגעים", "אותך")} "for if you gather them as particulars they weary you"; {SP_(306, 29, "אבל", "מצרפם", "ועושה", "אותם", "סלעים")} "but he combines them and makes them selas"; {SP_(306, 29, "ועושה", "אותם", "דינרי", "זהב")} "and makes them gold dinars"): R. MEIR\'S COINAGE — the general rule the gold dinar that carries a thousand particulars; THE ENGLISH ROW CORRUPTED IN THE EXPORT ("with all the creatures in the world" and a run of stray letters — a fragment from another row), the verdict from the Hebrew alone (sitting 18\'s lesson 4: a translator\'s misprint is judged by the Hebrew). The compile: the method\'s own picture again (306:20); no law (DV32-01). Fresh.')
